    "provinceDeepAtlasProfile": {
      "oneLine": "Drakmorren is centered at 64.919542, 132.231826 under Oligarchy, with 41,202,000 people across 10 settlements.",
      "extremeAtlasDescription": "Drakmorren occupies  sq mi /  sq km of modeled Earth-sized territory. Its province terrain is led by Mountain range, Deep cavern, Beach and reefs with water. Grimvald, Fenwyrd, and Heth'vára anchor the mountain record: Grimvald descends through deep caverns with underworld rumors, Fenwyrd is a deep mountain city, and Heth'vára is a hybrid town partly perched on a mountain side.",
      "peopleFactionsAndFaith": "The strongest public people-groups are Humans, Near-Humans, and Mixed Heritage, Halfling and Smallfolk, Animalfolk and Mammalian Anthropomorphs, Amphibious and Aquatic Peoples, Dwarven and Gnomish Kin, Draconic and Reptilian Races, and 2 more. Frequently recorded peoples include Human, Halfling — Lightfoot Halfling, Gnome — Rock Gnome, Elf — Sea Elf, Tortle, Triton, Merfolk, Halfling — Stout Halfling, and 4 more. Faction visibility leans toward The Nefaric Veil, with worship and patronage records naming Nebyrr, Nefarokir, Eirzunet, Ishtanora, Iskareth, Bastveig, Marduthor, and 3 more.",
